PRODUCT REQUIREMENT DOCUMENT (PRD)

0. Bahasa Antarmuka (WAJIB)
Semua pesan API, validasi, error, label, seeder, dan respons JSON yang ditujukan ke pengguna wajib berbahasa Indonesia.
Kode internal (nama class, variabel, route path) boleh tetap bahasa Inggris sesuai konvensi Laravel.

1. Project Overview
Nama Produk: BMS — Belawa Management System (sebelumnya Multi-Branch Financial Tracker API).
Tujuan Proyek: Sistem terpusat multi-cabang untuk:
- Keuangan kas (transaksi, akun, rekonsiliasi, transfer, kunci periode).
- Operasional konter (catatan servis, target closingan, gaji).
- Operasional bengkel (upah kerja mingguan per teknisi).
- SDM (data karyawan, absensi).
- Laporan & dasbor agregat.
Target Pengguna: Super Admin (Owner) dan Admin Cabang.
Cabang awal (seed): Sawai, Waebulen, Bengkel Belawa, Lukulamo (tipe konter/bengkel via branch_types).

2. Tech Stack & Architecture
Framework Back-end: Laravel (API Mode / Stateless Bearer Token).
Frontend: SPA Vue (CDN) di /app/ yang mengonsumsi REST API via Sanctum token (bukan session Blade sebagai UI utama).
Database: PostgreSQL (ACID + foreign key ketat).
Autentikasi API: Laravel Sanctum (Token-based).
PDF Laporan: DomPDF (barryvdh/laravel-dompdf) via signed URL sementara.
Integrasi Pihak Ketiga:
- n8n: Menerima webhook outbound dari Laravel (N8N_WEBHOOK_URL) untuk notifikasi transfer pending dan alert selisih rekonsiliasi; akses DB n8n (jika dipakai) wajib user PostgreSQL terpisah dengan hak terbatas.
- WAHA (WhatsApp HTTP API): Diorkestrasi melalui n8n (bukan langsung dari Laravel pada tahap ini).

3. User Roles & Permissions
Multi-Tenancy Scoping di tingkat API + tipe cabang (konter vs bengkel).
Tipe cabang ditentukan oleh branch_types.allows_service:
- allows_service = true → Konter (boleh modul servis, closing, gaji konter).
- allows_service = false → Bengkel (boleh modul upah kerja; tidak boleh input servis/closing).

A. Super Admin / Owner (Global Scope)
- Mengelola cabang, tipe cabang, akun global, admin cabang, kategori, karyawan.
- Melihat dasbor agregat seluruh cabang (filter bulan/tahun/cabang).
- Mengunci/membuka periode pembukuan bulanan.
- Membuat jurnal penyesuaian saldo (adjustments).
- Menyetujui/menolak transfer lintas cabang (konfirmasi kata sandi Owner).
- Gaji Konter (payroll): hitung, simpan manual, kunci/buka — owner only.
- Upah Bengkel: lihat semua cabang bengkel; boleh reopen minggu lunas.
- Semua jenis laporan (termasuk gaji).

B. Admin Cabang (Isolated Scope)
- Transaksi, rekonsiliasi, transfer internal/antar cabang (request), akun/kategori cabang sesuai hak.
- Absensi karyawan cabangnya.
- Jika cabang konter: Catatan Servis, Target Closingan (bukan Gaji Konter).
- Jika cabang bengkel: Upah Kerja (input job, tandai minggu lunas); bukan servis/closing/gaji.
- Laporan sesuai tipe cabang (servis/closing hanya konter; upah hanya bengkel; gaji tidak untuk admin).
Batasan: 403 Forbidden jika memodifikasi periode terkunci, mengakses cabang lain, atau membuka modul yang tidak sesuai tipe cabang.

4. Functional Requirements (API Endpoints)

A. Autentikasi (/api/auth)
POST /api/auth/login → Token bearer Sanctum (throttle).
GET /api/auth/demo-accounts → Daftar akun uji (jika diaktifkan).
POST /api/auth/logout → Hapus token aktif.
GET /api/auth/me → Profil user login (+ branch + allows_service).
POST /api/auth/confirm-password → Validasi ulang kata sandi (approve transfer); tidak menerbitkan token baru.

B. Cabang, Tipe Cabang & Admin [Owner untuk tulis]
GET/POST/PUT /api/branches
GET/POST/PUT/DELETE /api/branch-types
PUT /api/branch-types/{id}/accounts → Sync akun default per tipe.
GET /api/branches/{id}/account-settings ; PUT /api/branches/{id}/accounts
GET/POST/PUT /api/admins

C. Akun, Saldo Awal & Kategori
GET/POST/PUT/DELETE /api/accounts (hapus: owner)
GET/PUT /api/opening-balances → Saldo awal per akun×cabang (+ tanggal efektif)
GET/POST/PUT /api/categories → Kategori global (owner) / lokal cabang (admin) sesuai aturan scope

D. Transaksi
GET/POST/PUT/DELETE /api/transactions
Aturan: wajib category_id + account_id; kunci periode → 403 jika tanggal pada bulan is_locked.
Audit Log untuk CREATE/UPDATE/DELETE transaksi.

E. Transfer Dana
POST /api/transfers/internal → Mutasi antar akun dalam cabang (pasangan expense+income amount sama).
POST /api/transfers/inter-branch/request → PENDING; reason opsional; webhook Owner.
POST /api/transfers/inter-branch/{id}/approve [Owner] → APPROVED + mutasi (DB transaction); frontend wajib confirm-password.
POST /api/transfers/inter-branch/{id}/reject [Owner] → REJECTED + rejection_reason wajib.

F. Kontrol Finansial
GET/POST /api/period-locks [Owner]
POST /api/reconciliations → Selisih fisik vs sistem; ≠0 → webhook n8n. Rekonsiliasi per akun.
POST /api/adjustments [Owner] → Jurnal penyesuaian (wajib reason).

G. Dasbor
GET /api/dashboard/owner [Owner]
  Filter: year, month, branch_id (opsional).
  Metrik: omzet/beban/profit/saldo + vs bulan lalu; service summary (konter);
  payroll summary; closing vs target; absensi hari ini; upah bengkel minggu ini;
  chart komparasi/arus kas; top kategori; transfer pending; alert selisih; saldo per cabang/akun.
GET /api/dashboard/branch
  Saldo, omzet/beban bulan ini, status rekonsiliasi (dicek hari ini / akun stale),
  absensi hari ini; konter: service + closing + net profit; bengkel: upah minggu ini;
  saldo per akun; top kategori; log transaksi terakhir; banner kunci periode.

H. Karyawan & Absensi
GET/POST/PUT/DELETE /api/employees [tulis: Owner]
GET/PUT /api/attendance/daily → Absensi harian (present|leave|sick|absent)
GET /api/attendance/board → Rekap bulanan H/I/S/A
Akses: Owner semua cabang; Admin hanya cabangnya.

I. Konter — Catatan Servis (hanya cabang allows_service)
GET/POST/PUT/DELETE /api/service-records
Field: employee_id (teknisi), service_date, brand, device_type, damage, cost, price, profit(=price−cost), notes.
Admin bengkel: 403.

J. Konter — Target Closingan (hanya cabang allows_service)
GET /api/closings/board → Board bulanan qty vs target per karyawan non-manajemen.
PUT /api/closings/targets → Target bulanan per karyawan.
PUT /api/closings/daily → Qty closing harian.
Admin bengkel: 403.

K. Konter — Gaji (Payroll) [Owner only]
GET /api/payrolls/board → Board bulanan per cabang konter.
PUT /api/payrolls/save → Simpan/hitung ulang + field manual (acc, bonus, hutang, pengeluaran, note).
POST /api/payrolls/lock | /unlock
GET /api/payrolls/detail
Rumus (v1):
- Gapok = present_days × 50.000 (promotor = 0)
- Insentif HP = closing_qty × 10.000
- Insentif Service = 50% × service_profit (teknisi/service)
- Total = gapok + HP + service + acc + bonus − hutang − pengeluaran
Status: draft | locked. Sumber: absensi + closing + service records.

L. Bengkel — Upah Kerja (hanya cabang !allows_service)
GET/PUT /api/workshop-wages/settings → % share per teknisi per bulan (default 50%).
GET/POST/PUT/DELETE /api/workshop-wages/jobs → Job harian (job_type, amount, employee_id).
GET /api/workshop-wages/weeks | /weeks/detail
POST /api/workshop-wages/weeks/pay → Tandai minggu (Senin–Minggu) lunas; simpan shares_snapshot.
POST /api/workshop-wages/weeks/reopen [Owner] → Buka kembali minggu lunas.
GET /api/workshop-wages/technicians | /job-types
Aturan: minggu paid → tidak boleh ubah job; upah net = gross × (tech_share_pct/100).
Admin konter: 403.

M. Laporan (/api/reports)
GET /api/reports/{type} → JSON preview.
GET /api/reports/{type}/pdf-link → Signed URL sementara (disposition=attachment|inline).
GET /api/reports/{type}/pdf-file → File PDF (middleware signed).
Jenis laporan:
  Keuangan: ringkasan, kategori, akun, transaksi, transfer, rekonsiliasi
  Konter: servis, closing, gaji (owner)
  Bengkel: upah
  SDM: absensi
PDF kosong tetap mencetak header BMS + meta periode/cabang + keterangan “tidak ada data”.
UI: Export PDF = unduh; Buka PDF = tab baru (inline).

5. Database Schema (PostgreSQL) — inti
A. branch_types — code, name, allows_service, status, …
B. branches — id, name, type(FK code branch_types), address, status, timestamps
C. users — id, branch_id(nullable), name, email, password, role(owner|admin), timestamps
D. accounts — id, name, code, … ; pivot account_branch
E. account_opening_balances — branch_id, account_id, amount, effective_date, …
F. categories — id, name, type(income|expense), branch_id(nullable=global), …
G. transactions — id, branch_id, user_id, category_id, account_id, amount, description, transaction_date, …
H. inter_branch_transfers — … status(pending|approved|rejected), reason, rejection_reason, account_id, …
I. reconciliations — branch_id, account_id, user_id, system_balance, physical_balance, difference, reconciliation_date
J. period_locks — branch_id, period(YYYY-MM), is_locked, locked_by; unique(branch_id, period)
K. audit_logs — user_id, table_name, record_id, action, old_values, new_values
L. employees — branch_id, name, phone, position, status(active|inactive), joined_at, notes
M. employee_attendances — employee_id, attendance_date, status(present|leave|sick|absent), note, input_by; unique(employee_id, date)
N. employee_daily_closings — employee_id, closing_date, qty, input_by
O. employee_monthly_targets — employee_id, year, month, target, set_by
P. service_records — branch_id, employee_id, user_id, service_date, brand, device_type, damage, cost, price, profit, notes
Q. payrolls — branch_id, employee_id, year, month, status(draft|locked), snapshots & komponen gaji, total, locked_at, …
R. workshop_jobs — branch_id, employee_id, job_date, job_type, amount, note, input_by
S. workshop_wage_settings — branch_id, employee_id, year, month, tech_share_pct, set_by
T. workshop_weeks — branch_id, week_start, week_end, status(open|paid), shares_snapshot(json), paid_at, paid_by

5.1 Relasi Database (FK & batasan unik penting)
Inti cabang & user
- branches.type → branch_types.code
- users.branch_id → branches.id (null = Owner global)
- period_locks.branch_id → branches.id ; period_locks.locked_by → users.id
- audit_logs.user_id → users.id

Akun & kategori
- account_branch: account_id → accounts.id ; branch_id → branches.id (pivot M:N akun×cabang)
- account_opening_balances: branch_id → branches.id ; account_id → accounts.id ; unique(branch_id, account_id) [atau per effective_date sesuai migrasi]
- categories.branch_id → branches.id (null = kategori global)
- (opsional) account_branch_type / sync akun default: account × branch_types

Keuangan
- transactions.branch_id → branches.id
- transactions.user_id → users.id ; transactions.updated_by → users.id (jika ada)
- transactions.category_id → categories.id
- transactions.account_id → accounts.id
- inter_branch_transfers.from_branch_id → branches.id ; to_branch_id → branches.id
- inter_branch_transfers.account_id → accounts.id
- inter_branch_transfers.requested_by → users.id ; approved_by → users.id
- reconciliations.branch_id → branches.id ; account_id → accounts.id ; user_id → users.id

SDM
- employees.branch_id → branches.id
- employee_attendances.employee_id → employees.id ; input_by → users.id
  unique(employee_id, attendance_date)
- employee_daily_closings.employee_id → employees.id ; input_by → users.id
  unique(employee_id, closing_date)
- employee_monthly_targets.employee_id → employees.id ; set_by → users.id
  unique(employee_id, year, month)

Konter
- service_records.branch_id → branches.id ; employee_id → employees.id ; user_id → users.id
  (employee harus satu cabang dengan branch_id record)
- payrolls.branch_id → branches.id ; employee_id → employees.id
  payrolls.locked_by → users.id ; input_by → users.id
  unique(branch_id, employee_id, year, month)

Bengkel
- workshop_jobs.branch_id → branches.id ; employee_id → employees.id ; input_by → users.id
- workshop_wage_settings.branch_id → branches.id ; employee_id → employees.id ; set_by → users.id
  unique(branch_id, employee_id, year, month)
- workshop_weeks.branch_id → branches.id ; paid_by → users.id
  unique(branch_id, week_start)
  shares_snapshot = JSON peta employee_id → % (bukan FK baris; snapshot saat pay)

Aturan integritas bisnis (bukan FK, wajib ditegakkan di aplikasi)
- Admin hanya mengakses/menulis data branch_id miliknya.
- Modul servis / closing / payroll hanya untuk cabang allows_service=true.
- Modul workshop_* hanya untuk cabang allows_service=false.
- Payroll mengambil agregat dari attendances + closings + service_records (tanpa FK langsung ke baris sumber; di-snapshot ke kolom payroll).
- Upah net dihitung dari workshop_jobs × workshop_wage_settings (atau shares_snapshot jika minggu paid).

6. Non-Functional & Security
Presisi finansial: NUMERIC/DECIMAL.
Audit trail: CREATE/UPDATE/DELETE transaksi → audit_logs.
n8n: N8N_WEBHOOK_URL; user DB terpisah jika akses langsung PostgreSQL.
CORS: FRONTEND_URL.
Signed URL PDF: kedaluwarsa singkat (~10 menit); validasi user_id + filter di query.
Scope cabang & tipe cabang ditegakkan di controller (bukan hanya UI).

7. UI/UX (SPA /app/)
A. Prinsip: Clean, dashboard-oriented.
Warna: Hijau #10B981 (pemasukan/approved), Merah #EF4444 (pengeluaran/rejected/selisih), Kuning #F59E0B (pending), Teal #0F766E (brand).
Owner: desktop/tablet; Admin: mobile-friendly.
B. Navigasi (urutan alur kerja)
1. Utama — Dasbor, Transaksi, Rekonsiliasi (+ Akun Cabang / Kategori untuk admin)
2. Transfer — Antar Akun, Antar Cabang
3. Konter — Catatan Servis, Target Closingan, Gaji Konter (sesuai hak)
4. Bengkel — Upah Kerja
5. Karyawan — Absensi, Data Karyawan (owner)
6. Laporan — Buat Laporan (tipe disaring per role/cabang)
7. Sistem [Owner] — Kelola, Penyesuaian, Kunci Periode
C. Owner Dasbor
Kartu keuangan + Gaji Konter + Closing/Target + Absensi hari ini + Upah Bengkel minggu ini;
blok Service per cabang (disembunyikan jika filter cabang bengkel);
chart; top kategori; transfer pending + alert selisih; saldo per cabang/akun.
D. Admin Dasbor
Banner merah baku jika periode terkunci.
KPI kas + rekonsiliasi + absensi; konter: service/closing/net; bengkel: gross/upah/status minggu;
saldo per akun; top kategori; log transaksi + pintasan tambah.
E. Laporan
Pilih jenis → filter → Tampilkan / Export PDF / Buka PDF.
Export = unduh file; Buka = tab baru. Data kosong tetap ada header dokumen.
F. State
Skeleton loading dasbor; toast sukses/error; toast 403 kunci periode:
"Aksi Ditolak: Periode pembukuan telah dikunci oleh Owner." (atau pesan API setara).

8. Status Implementasi (referensi)
[DONE] Auth, cabang, tipe cabang, admin, akun, saldo awal, kategori, transaksi, transfer, rekonsiliasi, kunci periode, adjustments, audit.
[DONE] Karyawan, absensi, catatan servis, closing/target, gaji konter, upah bengkel.
[DONE] Dasbor owner/branch diperkaya KPI modul baru.
[DONE] Laporan multi-jenis + PDF (header wajib meski data kosong).
[OPTIONAL / BELUM WAJIB] Export CSV/Excel; webhook n8n end-to-end production; WAHA templates.
